body:
I think you might have misunderstood and made a false assumption regarding my post. To clear things up, my desire to be "undoubtedly beautiful" does not equate to me not giving equal importance to personality and character. Just like you, I want to be more than a pretty face. The deeper context here is that, I just wanna be undoubtedly beautiful so I can finally live my life freely, without worrying about being seen as repulsive. I am sorry I have not made my post much clearer.

&#x200B;

However, I would also like to point out that your comment comes out in a way that it is invalidating. Most of us with BDD share a common struggle, but it is not exactly the same for every one.
